      ],
      "text": "Rationale",
      "font": "SegoeUI-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        89.82263946533203,
        527.1273803710938,
        104.26564025878906
      ],
      "text": "The rationale for this recommendation is based on the evidence and considerations described in detail",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.961984634399414,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        103.02259063720703,
        527.3914794921875,
        117.46559143066406
      ],
      "text": "in the following two subsections. Briefly, data from an RCT (stage 2 of TB-PRACTECAL, corresponds",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        116.22272491455078,
        527.3848876953125,
        130.6657257080078
      ],
      "text": "to a Phase 3 trial) showed much improved treatment success rates with the BPaLM regimen (89%)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        129.42274475097656,
        527.5752563476562,
        143.86573791503906
      ],
      "text": "of 6 months duration compared with the current SoC regimens (52%), as well as lower levels of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        142.62269592285156,
        527.1768188476562,
        157.06568908691406
      ],
      "text": "treatment failure, death and loss to follow-up (LTFU). Data from two trials (TB-PRACTECAL and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        155.8227081298828,
        527.3837890625,
        170.2657012939453
      ],
      "text": "ZeNix) suggested fewer AEs with a linezolid dose of 600 mg while maintaining high efficacy. It was",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        169.02272033691406,
        527.1658325195312,
        183.46571350097656
      ],
      "text": "judged that implementing this regimen was probably feasible and acceptable, with cost–effectiveness",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.981735229492188,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        182.2227325439453,
        527.3916015625,
        196.6657257080078
      ],
      "text": "and equity probably improved. The comparison of patient groups receiving this regimen with those",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        195.42274475097656,
        527.4102172851562,
        209.86573791503906
      ],
      "text": "receiving currently recommended regimens lasting 9 months or longer has favoured the 6-month",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        208.62269592285156,
        463.68609619140625,
        223.06568908691406
      ],
      "text": "BPaLM regimen, suggesting it to be the regimen of choice for eligible patient groups.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        236.44003295898438,
        191.23452758789062,
        252.29202270507812
      ],
      "text": "Summary of evidence",
      "font": "SegoeUI-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        259.4998779296875,
        527.58935546875,
        273.9429016113281
      ],
      "text": "This section provides the PICO questions posed, the data and studies considered to answer the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        272.69989013671875,
        527.5255737304688,
        287.1429138183594
      ],
      "text": "questions, the methods used for analysis and data synthesis, a summary of evidence on desirable and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.977928161621094,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        285.89990234375,
        527.4221801757812,
        300.3429260253906
      ],
      "text": "undesirable effects and certainty of evidence, and a summary of other evidence considered during",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        299.09979248046875,
        527.435546875,
        313.5428161621094
      ],
      "text": "the recommendation’s development. Additional detail on the evidence is available in the annexes",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        312.18994140625,
        454.06329345703125,
        326.7429504394531
      ],
      "text": "Annex 5 containing the GRADE evidence summary tables and GRADE EtD tables ( ).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        343.1437072753906,
        153.59291076660156,
        358.8037109375
      ],
      "text": "PICO questions",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        366.01171875,
        527.3816528320312,
        380.4547424316406
      ],
      "text": "The recommendation in this section is a result of assessments of the PICO questions listed below.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        379.2117004394531,
        527.4410400390625,
        393.65472412109375
      ],
      "text": "Because of the different intervention and comparator groups used, PICOs 3, 5, and 6 have been split",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.999800682067871,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        392.3017272949219,
        433.4328918457031,
        406.854736328125
      ],
      "text": "Table 1.3 into several sub-PICO questions (details are given in the text and in  ).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        83.86609649658203,
        412.839599609375,
        515.8999633789062,
        428.50360107421875
      ],
      "text": "PICO question 3–2022 (MDR/RR-TB, 2022): Should BPaL regimens with lower linezolid exposure",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        83.86609649658203,
        426.03961181640625,
        515.91845703125,
        441.70361328125
      ],
      "text": "(dose or duration) be used instead of the original BPaL regimen in patients who are eligible for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        83.86609649658203,
        439.2395935058594,
        153.08689880371094,
        454.9035949707031
      ],
      "text": "BPaL regimen?",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        83.86609649658203,
        460.943603515625,
        515.8614501953125,
        476.60760498046875
      ],
      "text": "PICO question 4–2022 (MDR/RR-TB, 2022): Should 6-month regimen using bedaquiline,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        83.86609649658203,
        474.14349365234375,
        516.0309448242188,
        489.8074951171875
      ],
      "text": "pretomanid, linezolid be used in patients with pulmonary pre-XDR-TB (MDR/RR-TB with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        83.86609649658203,
        487.3435974121094,
        208.9723663330078,
