        83.86609649658203,
        509.0474853515625,
        515.7898559570312,
        524.7114868164062
      ],
      "text": "PICO question 5–2022 (MDR/RR-TB, 2022): Should 6-month regimen using bedaquiline, pretomanid",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
