        83.86609649658203,
        557.1513671875,
        515.9396362304688,
        572.8153686523438
      ],
      "text": "PICO question 6–2022 (MDR/RR-TB, 2022): Should 6-month regimen using bedaquiline,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        83.86609649658203,
        570.3514404296875,
        515.6194458007812,
        586.0154418945312
      ],
      "text": "pretomanid and linezolid with or without addition of moxifloxacin (BPaLM) or clofazimine be",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        83.86609649658203,
        583.5513916015625,
        489.9441833496094,
        599.2153930664062
      ],
      "text": "used in patients with pulmonary MDR/RR-TB (with or without fluoroquinolone resistance)?",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        615.6713256835938,
        224.82371520996094,
        631.3313598632812
      ],
      "text": "Data and studies considered",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        638.5391845703125,
        524.5035400390625,
        652.982177734375
      ],
      "text": "The review of this group of PICO questions during the GDG meeting convened by WHO in February–",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.986190795898438,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        651.7393188476562,
        527.3450317382812,
        666.1823120117188
      ],
      "text": "March 2022 was based on new evidence provided by MSF from the TB-PRACTECAL clinical trial",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        664.9393310546875,
        527.382568359375,
        679.38232421875
      ],
      "text": "and by the TB Alliance from the ZeNix trial. For several assessments under this PICO question, the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        678.1392211914062,
        527.4243774414062,
        692.5822143554688
      ],
      "text": "data from the 2021 WHO individual patient dataset (IPD) were used. Patient populations included in",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        691.3392333984375,
        527.4002685546875,
        705.7822265625
      ],
      "text": "two trials were recruited following strict inclusion and exclusion criteria; the populations had many",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        704.5391845703125,
        527.279541015625,
        718.982177734375
      ],
      "text": "similarities and few notable differences. The highlights of the criteria used by these trials are presented",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.97426986694336,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        717.6293334960938,
        467.2733154296875,
        732.1823120117188
      ],
      "text": "Table 1.1 in  . For a complete list of the exclusion criteria, see published trial protocols. 24",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
